{"path":"chemistry/experiments/lab/industrial-process","title":"化学工艺流程题模板","type":"knowledge","html":"<h1>化学工艺流程题模板</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>工艺流程题 = 课本实验 + 工业思维，考的是&quot;操作目的&quot;和&quot;原理分析&quot;。设问高度套路化，模板背熟直接对号入座。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>流程图的读法（三步）</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>抓主线</strong>：原料 → 预处理 → 核心反应 → 分离提纯 → 产品（箭头方向就是反应顺序）；</li>\n<li><strong>找副线</strong>：循环利用的物质（箭头指回前面的）、副产物（多用于&quot;经济/环保&quot;设问）；</li>\n<li><strong>标状态</strong>：固/液/气、温度、pH——每个条件都是设问点。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>高频设问与标准答案模板</h2>\n<p><strong>&quot;加快反应速率/提高浸取率&quot;</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>增大接触面积（粉碎/搅拌）、适当升温、适当增大浓度（酸/碱）、延长浸取时间。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>&quot;某操作的目的&quot;</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>过滤：分离固液；蒸发浓缩冷却结晶：得到晶体（可溶性盐）；趁热过滤：防止晶体析出损失；</li>\n<li>洗涤：除去表面杂质（&quot;用…洗涤，目的是…&quot;）；</li>\n<li>调 pH：使某离子<strong>完全沉淀</strong>而其他离子不沉淀（&quot;控制 pH 使 Fe³⁺ 转化为 Fe(OH)₃ 沉淀除去&quot;）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>&quot;循环利用&quot;</strong>：降低成本、提高原料利用率、减少污染。</p>\n<p><strong>&quot;加过量 X 的目的&quot;</strong>：使反应物 Y 完全反应（提高 Y 的转化率）。</p>\n<p><strong>&quot;温度不宜过高&quot;</strong>：防止 X 分解/挥发/发生副反应（如 H₂O₂ 受热分解、NH₄HCO₃ 受热分解）。</p>\n<h2>常见&quot;工业手段&quot;背后的原理</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>粉碎/研磨</td>\n<td>增大接触面积，加快反应速率，提高浸取率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>酸浸/碱浸</td>\n<td>使目标成分进入溶液（或使杂质溶解）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>氧化剂（H₂O₂/Cl₂）</td>\n<td>将低价离子氧化为高价（便于沉淀分离）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萃取</td>\n<td>溶质在两种溶剂中溶解度差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电解精炼</td>\n<td>阳极溶解阴极沉积，分离杂质</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>计算与 Ksp 结合（难点）</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>&quot;完全沉淀&quot; = 离子浓度 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mol/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;10^{-5}\\,\\text{mol/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mol/L</span></span></span></span></span>：由 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{sp}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 反推所需 pH；</li>\n<li>沉淀先后：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{sp}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 小的先沉淀（同类型）；</li>\n<li>答题模板：&quot;由 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>H</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{sp}(Fe(OH)_3)=…</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.123em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span> 得 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>F</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(Fe^{3+})=10^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>H</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(OH^-)=…</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0213em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.123em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">pH=…</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.123em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span>，故调 pH 至…&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>邪修提示</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>设问&quot;目的/作用/原因&quot;：<strong>从速率、转化率、分离、安全、环保五个角度凑</strong>，写全不扣分；</li>\n<li>流程题先看&quot;循环箭头&quot;——循环物质设问必有一问；</li>\n<li>陌生方程式书写：根据流程中&quot;反应物→产物&quot;配平（电子守恒+电荷守恒）；</li>\n<li>风险：答题必须&quot;<strong>结合本流程</strong>&quot;（写&quot;使 Fe³⁺ 沉淀&quot;而不是泛泛的&quot;调节 pH&quot;），空话不给分。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":null,"evilHtml":null,"meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":["工艺流程","浸取","除杂","循环利用","操作目的"],"summary":"化学工艺流程题模板 工艺流程题 = 课本实验 + 工业思维，考的是&quot;操作目的&quot;和&quot;原理分析&quot;。设问高度套路化，模板背熟直接对号入座。 流程图的读法（三步） 抓主线 ：原料 → 预处理 → 核心反应 →","fit":[],"updated":"Thu Feb 06 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"chemistry","title":"化学"},{"slug":"experiments","title":"化学实验"},{"slug":"lab","title":"化学实验"},{"slug":"industrial-process","title":"化学工艺流程题模板"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"design-evaluation","title":"实验方案设计与评价","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"experiments","title":"化学实验专题","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"gas-prep","title":"气体制备与净化（先除杂后干燥）","type":"example"},{"slug":"gas-purify","title":"气体净化与干燥顺序（除杂为先、干燥在后）","type":"example"},{"slug":"haloalkane-br-test","title":"溴乙烷中溴元素的检验","type":"example"},{"slug":"industrial-flow-example","title":"工业流程除杂（调 pH 不引杂质）","type":"example"},{"slug":"solution-prep-error","title":"配制溶液误差分析（定容俯仰视）","type":"example"}]}